  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-4)">▁</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="109.8" y="117.6" textLength="756.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-4)">▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="866.2" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-4)">▁</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-4)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-5)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="142" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-5)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-5)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-5)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-6)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="166.4" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-6)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-6)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-6)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-7)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="190.8" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-7)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-7)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-7)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-8)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="215.2" textLength="244" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-8)">I&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-8)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-8)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-9)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="239.6" textLength="585.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-9)">I&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-9)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-9)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-10)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="264" textLength="732" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-10)">And&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-10)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-10)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-11)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="288.4" textLength="109.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-11)">its&#160;path.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-11)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-11)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-12)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="312.8" textLength="719.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-12)">Where&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-12)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-12)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-13)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r1" x="109.8" y="337.2" textLength="85.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-13)">remain.</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r4" x="866.2" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-13)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-13)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="97.6" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-14)">▔</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="109.8" y="361.6" textLength="756.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-14)">▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r3" x="866.2" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-14)">▔</text><text class="terminal-3234129636-r2" x="976" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3234129636-line-14)">
