      <text class="terminal-3484348706-r1" x="0" y="20" textLength="951.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-0)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.&#160;Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.&#160;Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings</text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r2" x="976" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-0)">
