      <g class="terminal-1624210960-matrix">
      <text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-0)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-1)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="68.8" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-2)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-2)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="93.2" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-3)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-3)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="117.6" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-4)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r3" x="902.8" y="117.6" textLength="48.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-4)">▁▁▁▁</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-4)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="142" textLength="244" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-5)">I&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-5)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="166.4" textLength="585.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-6)">I&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-6)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="190.8" textLength="841.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-7)">And&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its&#160;path.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-7)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="215.2" textLength="805.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-8)">Where&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;remain.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-8)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="239.6" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-9)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-9)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="264" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-10)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-10)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="288.4" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-11)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-11)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r2" x="48.8" y="312.8" textLength="244" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-12)">I&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-12)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-13)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-14)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1624210960-r1" x="976" y="386" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1624210960-line-15)">
