  </text><text class="terminal-454878977-r9" x="48.8" y="386" textLength="24.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-15)">●&#160;</text><text class="terminal-454878977-r1" x="73.2" y="386" textLength="85.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-15)">Headers</text><text class="terminal-454878977-r3" x="976" y="386" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-15)">
  </text><text class="terminal-454878977-r9" x="48.8" y="410.4" textLength="24.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-16)">●&#160;</text><text class="terminal-454878977-r1" x="73.2" y="410.4" textLength="317.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-16)">Lists&#160;(bullet&#160;and&#160;ordered)</text><text class="terminal-454878977-r3" x="976" y="410.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-454878977-line-16)">
