  </text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r7" x="97.6" y="264" textLength="73.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-10)">double</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="341.6" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-10)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r8" x="402.6" y="264" textLength="244" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-10)">I&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="915" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-10)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r3" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-10)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r5" x="0" y="288.4" textLength="268.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r9" x="268.4" y="288.4" textLength="24.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">▅▅</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="341.6" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r8" x="402.6" y="288.4" textLength="451.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">I&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="915" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r3" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-11)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r1" x="0" y="312.8" textLength="268.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-12)">▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="341.6" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-12)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r8" x="402.6" y="312.8" textLength="134.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-12)">through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="915" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-12)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r3" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-12)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r7" x="97.6" y="337.2" textLength="61" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-13)">heavy</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="341.6" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-13)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r8" x="402.6" y="337.2" textLength="463.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-13)">And&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="915" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-13)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r3" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-13)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r5" x="0" y="361.6" textLength="268.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-14)">▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="341.6" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-14)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r8" x="402.6" y="361.6" textLength="366" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-14)">the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its&#160;path.</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r6" x="915" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-14)">|</text><text class="terminal-1538625093-r3" x="976" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1538625093-line-14)">
